ter he infiltrated Marlay by  pretending to be a wounded veteran and  he established contact with his  half-brother Zeke who was also plotting  against Marley together they launched an  attack on the burial captured the  Warhammer Titan power and with the help  of armen's colossal titan they destroyed  a large chunk of Marley's army however  in the process of capturing the  Warhammer Titan a lot of innocent people  including LD ins were killed in Lipari  oh these casualties were a direct result  of Aaron's decision not to sit back and  to take the war to the enemy so this is  a burden that he now must bear on his  shoulders on top of that after consuming  the Warhammer Titan Aaron's personality  changed with three Titan powers inside  of him Aaron's mine is filled with the  memories of hundreds of previous Titan  shifters and he has recently begun to  appear mentally unstable and if that  wasn't enough as he has gotten closer to  Zeke Aaron has deliberately distanced  himself from his closest friends  including Mikasa and Armin Aaron  insulted Mikasa by insinuating that she  only defends him because her Ackerman  jeans are biologically programmed to do  it and when Armin protested against  Aaron's behavior Aaron physically  assaulted Armin all of this has raised  questions about whether Aaron has come  full circle and become the embodiment of  the famous saying from The Dark Knight  you either die a hero or live long  enough to see yourself become the  villain and once we learned what Zeke's  ultimate plan actually is if Aaron  really supports it then it isn't hard to  make the argument that Aaron has become  the villain now let's look at Zeke as we  know Zeke had a very tough childhood  because his father intended to use him  as nothing more than a tool to help the  LDN restoration is to destroy Marlay and  at a very young age Zeke was forced to  betray his own parents to the  authorities in order to save his own  life and the lives of his grandparents  after that Zeke appeared to be a loyal  male a warrior serving them as the Beast  Titan shifter but it turns out later  that Zeke's ultimate plan was to betray  Marlay in order to get his hands on the  founding titan power but the reason it's  equal  once the founding tightened power is not  to save his own people the audience but  rather to euthanize them back when he  was still training to become the Beast  Titan Zeke learned from his mentor Tom  Xavier that whoever possessed the  founding Titan power could change not  only the memories of all LD ins but also  their biological makeup by this point  Zeke had decided that the life on LDN  was nothing but suffering and that their  ability to turn into titans would always  make them pariahs among the other  nations of the world for this reason  Zeke decided that the best thing for the  audience is to simply go extinct he  decided to use the founding Titan power  to make all LD and sterile so that this  generation of LD ends would become the  very last generation but because Zeke  has royal blood  if he tried to take the founder for  himself he would be overtaken by the  145th king's pacifist ideology so he  decided that he must work together with  Aaron instead because Aaron possesses  the founding Titan power without having  royal blood now even though I can relate  to the struggle and hardships that Zeke  had to go through as a child both at the  hands of his parents and at the hands of  the Marlon regime I cannot support his  plan as I said before the audience were  alive today did not choose to be born  with the power to turn into Titans and  they are not responsible for the alleged  sins of their ancestors  Zeke's idea that all LD ends deserve to  simply die off is no better than the  oppressive and discriminatory believes  that the Marlins have about ldiots and  this type of self-hatred that Zeke is  exhibiting is a good example of  internalized racism Zeke has witnessed  the audience being mistreated and  discriminated against all his life and  in his mind he has come to accept that  there is something wrong with the  audience in reality there is something  wrong with those individuals who choose  to abuse and discriminate against  innocent people the fault does not live  with the people who are being abused  so is Zeke a villain yes if this is  really his plan then I would call him a  villain albeit a villain who is a  traumatized and tortured soul we can all  understand how Zeke's traumatic life has  led him to do the things he has done  but just because we can understand that  his life was difficult doesn't mean that  we should support the genocide or plan  that he wants to implement  on his own people Zeke might have turned  against Marley but his plan is in line  with the wishes of the most viciously  aunty L D and Marlins it is ironic that  throughout his childhood Zeke suffered  discrimination at the hands of the  Marlins including being forced to wear a  special armband when in public so that  everyone would know that he was LD and  these armbands are part of the reason  why Zeke faced abuse and discrimination  on a daily basis from aggressive Marlins  for instance in Chapter 114 we see an  instance when a young Zeke and his  parents were out on a rooftop of a  building overlooking the barrio just  talking and enjoying the view and then  mr lay and janitor sees their arm bends  he instantly attacks them throwing water  all over them and insulting them he  demands to know how these descendents of  the devil would dare to reproduce and  have more children  the janitor believed that the LD ins  were inherently evil this part of the  devil and that they shouldn't be allowed  to even have children this was a deeply  traumatizing experience for Zeke and yet  as an adult he is essentially carrying  out the wishes of that Marley and  janitor to make the irony complete after  Zeke tainted some wine with his spinal  fluid so that key members of the survey  corps on paradise would turn into Titans  as soon as he screamed those LD ins who  consumed the wine were required to wear  black armbands to differentiate them  from those who didn't drink the wine how  sad and ironic that after living through  the cruel treatment that the audience  faced in Marley including being forced  to wear armbands to prove that they are  different from everyone else  Zeke decided to pursue a plan that the  very Marlins who abused him and his  family would have wholeheartedly  supported and because of Zeke other LD  ins were forced to wear armbands in  order to be differentiated from their  fellow human beings  so yes Zeke is a villain but he is a  villain who was created by the  traumatizing and abusive circumstances  of his life the fact that he is the  beast Titan and the fact that he has a  plan that I would consider villainous  suggests that Zeke is the real monster  in attack on Titan although he is a  monster of maar león and grisha's making  the thing that differentiates human from  wild beasts and from the mindless Titans  is their ability to choose the right  path in life but Zeke wants to take that  choice away  from his own people by forcing them  never to reproduce again and this is so  similar to the Marlins taking away so  many basic human choices and freedoms  from the ldiots the real question is  what will Eren do now personally I agree  with Armin  I think Aaron is pretending to go along  with Zeek because he needs his help  especially since Zeke has royal blood  which allows Aaron to harness the power  of the founding Titan but ultimately I  believe that Aaron will reject Zeke's  euthanasia plan and I believe that he  will do his best to find a solution that  will allow the LD ins to coexist with  the other nations ironically the real  monsters an attack on Titan are not the  giant man-eating Titans the real  monsters and villains are humans like  the Malayan military and government or  members of the first interior squad who  are willing to torture and kill innocent  people a good illustration of this fact  is the character development of Gabi who  is an LDN that was completely  brainwashed by Marlin propaganda and  someone who genuinely believed that the  LDN zone parodies were all Devils and  that everything would be fine in the  world if not for them Gabi has  infuriated so many fans by her behavior  and actions towards her own people  all because of Marla's insidious and  vile propaganda  however in chapter 118 even Gabi finally  comes to the realization that there were  never any Devils on the island of  parodies only humans just like in Marley  and just like everywhere else in the  world but that doesn't mean that there  aren't any villains on the island it  just means that the true villains are  not monsters or Devils they are humans  this is the case on parodies in Marley  and everywhere else including our own  world the real monster in attack on  Titan is the human monster the monsters  are those individuals who haven't been  turned into mindless Titans those who  can still use their ability to think  rationally to think critically and to  empathize with fellow human beings but  they choose not to this is the key point  the real monsters are those who have a  choice  but still choose to do the evil immoral  thing the mindless Titans don't have a  real choice they are driven by natural  urges  nothing more sergeant-major grouse and  other Marlins like him do have a choice  Zeke does have a choice Aaron will have  a choice and I honestly hope that he  makes the right one our choices is what  distinguishes us from wild beasts and  making the conscious choice to do a  terrible thing is what makes you a  terrible person making the conscious  choice to act like a monster is what  makes you a monster and our own human  history tells us that far too often  humans have made that very choice but  let me know what you guys think who will  be the final villain in attack on titan  and what choice do you think that aaron  will make in the end will he side with  Zeke or will he ultimately choose to  side with Arman and Mikasa let me know  down in the comments I'd love to hear  your thoughts if you enjoyed the attack  on titan content on this channel and you  want to see more you can leave a like to  let me know and if you're new to anime  uproar please don't forget to subscribe  and hit that notification bell a huge  thank you to all of our anime uproar  patrons for supporting our work I want  to give a special thank you to our pro  hero to your patrons including the one  and only Gilgamesh chubs is the man and  nothing but a fan and another huge thank  you to our the one tier patrons the ones  who stand above all other clans  including baby ray ace in grata a  lowland Adam Maddy Mac and Michael  called that on if you guys feel that our  content provides value for you and you  want to support more be sure to check  out our patreon link in the description  even donating a single dollar will give  you access to our anime up for patron  exclusive discord and your name will  appear in our videos along with these  amazing people as always thank you guys  so much for watching I really appreciate  it and until next time see our space  cowboys  [Music]
 

